    { "id": "leg", "type": "rectangle", "x": 80, "y": 3730, "width": 1880, "height": 160, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "#1a1d20", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["leg"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 900, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 900, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "leg_lbl", "type": "text"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false },
    { "id": "leg_lbl", "type": "text", "x": 100, "y": 3745, "width": 1840, "height": 130, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e9ecef", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["leg"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 901, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 901, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "Legend\n\norange — orchestrator / scanner / Sonnet LLM agents     ·     teal — Haiku (cheap triage / audit)     ·     purple — external sources, OpenAI, multi-agent inputs/plan\nblue — Postgres / Supabase / Inngest / Clerk / Stripe / Browserless / R2 / Resend     ·     green — outputs + user-facing inbox / Next.js app     ·     orange — rate limiter\nred — Apply flow (planned)     ·     yellow — actors + onboarding aha     ·     gray — ops & observability (status-page, Axiom, Sentry, PostHog, seed scripts)\n\nSolid border = shipped today (scanner, enrichment, Supabase schema, status-page).     Dashed border = planned hosted-platform piece per HOSTED_PLATFORM_PLAN.md.\nPurple fan-out arrows = parallel (Promise.all).     White arrows = sequential.     Read top-to-bottom A → G.", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 12, "containerId": "leg", "originalText": "Legend", "lineHeight": 1.25 }
  ],
